"Iran is turning to buyers in East Asia to sell its petrochemicals and petroleum products," said Brian Nelson, undersecretary of state for finance, terrorism and financial intelligence. US sanctions. "The United States remains focused on targeting Tehran's illicit sources of revenue and continues to impose its sanctions on those who deliberately facilitate trade."
