Kampong Thom Provincial Administration Issues Clarification on RFA Reporting Alleging that Commune Authorities Removed and Destroyed Candlelight Party Labels
On February 9, 2023, Radio Free Asia (RFA) released a news item accusing local authorities of threatening the operation of the Candlelight Party and removing and destroying the party's banner. 3 candles in Popok commune, Trea commune and Samprochon commune, Stong district.
The provincial administration deeply regrets Radio Free Asia (RFA) coverage and the Candlelight Party's untrue allegations against local authorities. Authorities at all levels have given equal rights to all political parties to carry out their activities at the grassroots level without discrimination, intimidation or coercion.
The Kampong Thom provincial administration hopes that Radio Free Asia (RFA) will thoroughly check the basis of its information before publishing to avoid confusion, such as baseless allegations against local commune authorities.
