(Siem Reap): On February 9, 2023, the Siem Reap Provincial Police sent four male and female gangsters to temporary detention after conducting a search and arresting them on the night of February 7, 2023. Rubber in front of LXR Wat Bo gas station in Wat Bo village, Sala Kamroeuk commune, Siem Reap city, Siem Reap province, after they started a surprise operation in Siem Reap city.
Brigadier General Pheng Chendareth, Deputy Commissioner for Criminal Planning of the Siem Reap Provincial Police, said that before the incident, the perpetrator had his friend, who was in love with the victim through Facebook, come to the gas station. LXR Wat Bo went out to eat together at the bungalow.
The perpetrators have already prepared knives and belts. At 22:30 on the same day, the victim was driving a motorcycle alone to the above location. Suddenly, the perpetrator and two other accomplices chased the victim, but they saw him and hit the motorcycle and ran away.
After receiving the information, the police force cooperated with the intervention police force and the police force of Sala Kamroeuk Post until they arrested the four gangsters in a row and brought them for interrogation at the specialized office to prepare a case file to send them. He went to court and confiscated some exhibits, including two knives, an iron rod, a stick, a belt and some drug paraphernalia.
According to the confession of the perpetrator, the cause of this case is because the victim contacted (chat) his girlfriend.
