Mr. Mam Bunheng considered the presence of the Japanese Eye Hospital in Cambodia as an important contribution to the health sector in Cambodia. The Minister praised the vision and strong commitment of the management and staff of all Japanese eye clinics who have not given up their efforts in the past, especially in the face of the Kovid 19 crisis.
