(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Rural Development on February 9, 2023 issued a press release completely rejecting all baseless allegations and clear evidence. This is according to a press release obtained by Fresh News.
Recently, the Ministry of Rural Development has been using anonymous media and social media to spread propaganda, affecting the performance of the Ministry of Rural Development, an institution of the Royal Government. Government.
The Ministry of Rural Development strongly rejects all baseless allegations and clear evidence, intentionally slanders, incites public confusion and seriously damages the Ministry's honor and dignity.
In the past, the Ministry of Rural Development has tried to implement the rural development policy to improve the quality and value of life of rural people in a comprehensive environment, both economically, socially and culturally, in order to contribute to reducing poverty in accordance with the policy of The Royal Government under the wise and firm leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
By the end of 2022, more than 80% of the rural population will have access to clean water and good sanitation. Based on these living conditions, people in rural areas have the opportunity to have additional businesses and provide services to increase household income in addition to farming.
The above results are based on the strong will to work hard to carry out the work of leaders and civil servants at all levels based on respect for laws, regulations, policies and mechanisms in force correctly and strictly.
The Ministry will continue to pay more attention to the implementation of work in its jurisdiction more actively and responsibly. The Ministry of Rural Development hopes that the public will be informed with common sense.
