Kheang Phearum, spokesman for the Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration, told Fresh News on the morning of February 9, 2023 that the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, had instructed the provincial administration to coordinate with the site owners. After coordination from the provincial authorities, the site owner decided to knock down the fence at the back, along the beach.
Mr. Kheang Phearum continued, "After coordination from the provincial authorities, the owner of the fence also knocked out the fence on the beach on the night of February 8, 2023."
