Stung Treng Provincial Governor led professional officers and technical team to inspect the construction site of river bank in Stung Treng province
(Stung Treng): Mr. Svay Sam Eang, Governor of Stung Treng Province and Chairman of the Provincial Unity Command, on the afternoon of February 08, 2023, led a professional officer and technical team to inspect the construction site of the river bank to prevent possible river bank collapse. Affects roads and houses of people living along the banks of the Sekong River, as well as infrastructure in Stung Treng.
The inspection of the riverbank construction site was also attended by Mr. Si Suon, Deputy Governor, Deputy Director of the Department.
Mr. Svay Sam Eang said that this is another new achievement provided by the Royal Government with Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, which provides the entire people of Stung Treng to improve the beauty of Stung Treng as well as participate. The prevention and prevention of landslides that may occur eventually.
The provincial governor said that the construction of the river bank is currently 256 meters long, with the construction in stages and more than 6 kilometers from the Cambodia-China Friendship Bridge to the Friendship Bridge. Cambodia-China Mekong.
Taking this opportunity, Mr. Svay Sam Eang instructed the professional officers and the team to pay attention to continue to build this river bank with high quality to ensure the strength to avoid the river bank collapse that affects Homes of people living along the river and affecting infrastructure in Stung Treng.
