(Phnom Penh): The Spokesperson of the Royal Government on February 08, 2023 issued a statement rejecting all negative information that blames the humanitarian discouragement of the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen in providing assistance. Humanitarian aid to Turkey affected by natural disasters, earthquakes
