* First: Samdech Techo Prime Minister is mourning the loss of his family members.
* Second: Dr. Hun Manet is a senior member of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces who was elected and supported as a candidate for Prime Minister by members of the Cambodian People's Party, the ruling party with sufficient capacity to represent Special of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
* Third: Donation of humanitarian aid to the Republic of Turkey is the pride of Cambodia in the new era, a symbol of international cooperation between the two nations, and also the ability and ability of Cambodia to participate in international humanitarian activities.
Please be informed that the Royal Government of Cambodia has decided to provide US $ 100,000 in humanitarian aid to Turkey to help solve the difficulties caused by the earthquake. This is according to the confirmation of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Cambodia on the morning of February 8, 2023.
With this assistance, the Royal Government of Cambodia has expressed its deepest sympathy and sincere condolences to the Government and people of Turkey, especially the families of the bodies.
