Commentary: Why is the friendship between Cambodia and China going through longer and stronger?
Cambodia has repeatedly expressed its support for China's position in international affairs, especially adhering to the one-China principle, which is not only the voice of good friends, but also the voice of international truth. China, on the other hand, as the world's largest developing country, is aware of the plight of the same developing countries, and therefore has always provided all forms of assistance to our Cambodian friends.
Whether it is the Chinese who have lived for generations in Cambodia (Cambodians of Chinese descent) or the Chinese who have just come to live and invest in Cambodia, they all live in harmony with the Cambodian people. Indispensable contribution to the development of Cambodia, in particular, has helped to promote and strengthen the friendship between the people of Cambodia and China, which is a solid foundation for the maintenance of friendship.
In particular, when Cambodia began to spread Kovid, Cambodia became the first country to receive medical aid and the sending of medical experts from China, with the slogan "Help each other in "Knowing good friends in difficult times."
Samdech Techo announces China as a strategic reference in the supply of vaccines, which shows the strong trust of the Royal Government of Cambodia to Chinese friends, and the facts also confirm that the decision of the Royal Government of Cambodia is right because of the vaccine assistance. China has helped Cambodia build a social immune system and reduce the number of serious illnesses and deaths to a minimum.
Epidemics are not emotional, but we humans are sympathetic. Passing through mutual support in the fight against infectious diseases has shown the sincere love and friendship between the people of the two countries, which has formed a "steel friend" in the new era.
After a three-year absence, on February 9, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen will once again visit the territory he had "traveled in reverse" during the Kovid-19 outbreak. We can be confident that this visit will be a new symbol of strengthening ties between the two countries, which will push bilateral cooperation to a new level, especially accelerate the building of a common destiny of Cambodia and China. .
