The remains of 49 Cambodian National Rescue Armed Forces were handed over at the Koh Thmor X16 Military Historic Site in the presence of General Sao Sokha and Lieutenant General Do Kan, Deputy Chief of Political Affairs of the Vietnamese People's Army Foreign Affairs of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam, as well as the Armed Forces, local authorities, ladies and gentlemen, and the people of both Cambodia and Vietnam.
