Draft Law on Public Financial System and Draft Law on Water Management Approved by the National Assembly (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Two draft laws, namely Draft Law on Public Financial System and Draft Law on Water Supply Management Water management has been approved by the National Assembly on February 08, 2023.
This approval was made during the Extraordinary Session of the 6th National Assembly, chaired by Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly, in the presence of 107 members of the National Assembly at the beginning of the session.
