(Takeo): A group of hippies on three motorbikes chased each other anarchically, causing one person to die in a pool of blood with a machete. This incident happened on the afternoon of February 3, 2023, along National Road 2 in Chheuteal Phlos village, 8 Mom commune, Traing district, Takeo province.
Traing district police said that prior to the incident, a group of suspects on three motorcycles, about six from the north, armed with machetes, attacked two victims riding motorcycles from the same direction. Legs to the south, but not cut correctly.
The suspects then rode south to cut down on 17-year-old Pet Kosal Sithy, a resident of Banteay village, Chi Khma commune, Traing district, who was riding a motorcycle alone in the same direction for no apparent reason. The left side dies at the scene. After the action, the suspect rode a motorcycle to the south and escaped.
Currently, the district police force has cooperated with the specialized office force to search for the suspects to be punished according to the law, while the bodies of the victims have been handed over to their families for the traditional ceremony.
In this case, the people urged the authorities to help find the perpetrators and bring them to justice, because if these gangs are still allowed to continue such anarchic activities, he thinks that the commune is insecure. Too much.
