Linking religious beliefs to the conservation of natural resources
* Dedication to dolphins who die from nets, electric shocks and other causes.
* Educate the people living in the dolphin canyon area and live nearby to be grateful for the river, dolphins, fish and many other biodiversity and join together to protect by stopping all kinds of fishing where dolphins live and Stop fishing with electric nets, fishing nets, fishing rods and other illegal devices.
