(Kandal): Residents reported that on February 2, 2023, a business of collecting, distributing and killing birds in Prek Ta Ben village, Prek Anchanh commune, Muk Kampoul district, Kandal province, owned by Long Channary continued to operate. Although this business was closed by the professional team of the Ministry of Agriculture, Department of Agriculture, Kandal Province and local authorities in late January 2023 recently.
Bun Toun Simona, director of the Kandal Provincial Department of Agriculture, told Fresh News that the business of gathering, distributing and killing birds near the river was very damaging to the environment. Therefore, on December 1, 2022, he ordered to close the business and wait for the new location to be technically appropriate and have a valid permit in accordance with the law.
However, according to the report from the people until February 2, 2023, the above business is still operating illegally and asked professional officers and authorities to inspect and take strict legal action.
