Dr. Yong Pov, Secretary General of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, emphasized that the lecture on "History of Cambodia from Angkor to the Organization" really fits the current trend, along with knowledge of the socio-political evolution of Cambodia, which will show the Khmer Empire until the era of the organization. The most glorious period and the period of decline to zero in between 800 years) has been an important support document to remind the Cambodian people of the values of peace.
