(Phnom Penh): The National Assembly of the Cambodian National Confederation of Trade Unions (NACC), which represents nearly 500,000 workers, teachers, informal economy workers and farmers, has expressed strong hope that the eight key points presented at the Extraordinary General Assembly The whole country will attract the support of the people of all political tendencies and may make this old party win the parliamentary election in 2023 in July.
