(Phnom Penh): The case of the fire at the restaurant "New Place" located along the corner of Street 134, Street 233, Group 41, Village 2, Sangkat Phsar Depot 2, Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh on January 31, 2023, the death toll increased Three people, one of whom was seriously injured, died.
At the same time, Mr. Khuong Sreng, the Governor of Phnom Penh, assigned the Tuol Kork District Authority to bring gifts to the families of the dead.
In fact, on February 1, 2023, Mr. Chea Pisey, Governor of Toul Kork District, handed over the materials and budget of Mr. Khuong Sreng to the family of the deceased at Wat Teuk Thla with the permission of the Deputy Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court. The work led by Mr. Chan Bandith, Deputy Governor of Toul Kork District, to close the business location that caused the fire.
Please be reminded that the fire at the restaurant "New Place" located along Street 134, corner of Street 233, Group 41, Village 2, Sangkat Phsar Depot 2, Khan Toul Kork on the morning of January 31, 2023, caused men - Two women were killed and another was seriously injured and taken to Preah Kosomak Hospital for treatment, but unfortunately the victim died.
Colonel Prohm Yorn, director of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police Fire and Rescue Office, told Fresh News that after receiving the information about the restaurant fire, he immediately ordered a professional force to intervene. Extinguish in time to prevent the fire from spreading to nearby houses.
According to Colonel Prohm Yorn, in the rescue operation, 9 fire trucks of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police used 9 water trucks, 1 ambulance from Cambodia Beer Company used water. 1 car, 2 cars not used in Nora city and 2 cars in Olympia city not used water.
Colonel Prohm Yorn continued that the fire destroyed two motorcycles, some equipment in the shop, including concrete, zinc roof, with a size of 20 meters by 19 meters. One of the injured is currently being treated at Preah Keto Mealea Hospital, also known as Lok Sang Hospital, and the bodies of two other people are being kept at Stung Meanchey pagoda.
After the incident, the specialized force of the Tuol Kork Police Inspectorate called the chief for questioning at the Depot Market 2 police station.
