The Ministry of Education and the Ministry of Telecommunications announce the introduction of a temporary bankruptcy certificate with a standard QR Code
The issuance of this certificate is a new development in the use of digital technology to improve the provision of public services more easily and efficiently in accordance with the recommendations of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and a new step. To promote digital revolution in ministries, government institutions in line with the Cambodian Digital Economic and Social Policy Framework and the Cambodian Digital Government Policy.
Students can use this certificate to apply for admission to all higher education institutions without the need to legalize a copy of the provisional certificate in paper form, and all higher education institutions can scan the standard QR Code for verification. Validation of this certificate through the verification database verify.gov.kh.
For more information regarding the application, please contact 123 (toll free).
