(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sar Thet, Deputy Chief of National Task Force for Khan Meanchey and Chairman of Sangkat Boeung Tumpun 1, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh, established the Sangkat Youth Working Group to bring relevant documents to serve people at home. 574 documents (as of the end of January 2023) after those documents were completed in the commune without the need for people to bring to the commune itself.
The establishment of this working group has been highly appreciated and supported by the people living in Sangkat Boeung Tumpun I, Khan Meanchey. This team carries out the work under the direction of the chairman with high responsibility, taking the signed and stamped documents from the district to the people at home, whether at night or during the day when the people are free.
Mr. San Sok Seiha stated that "The establishment of this youth working group is very much taken care of by Mr. Sar Thet as the Deputy Chairman of the National Working Group for Meanchey District and the Chairman of the Working Group for Sangkat Boeung Tumpun." "Which always pays high attention to the provision of general services to the people, as well as high attention to the well-being of local people.
At the same time, Mr. Sar Thet always came to visit and find out about life as well as provide some money and materials to the very poor, the elderly, the homeless, such as the disabled and the elderly. Apart from that, he also advised all working groups to pay high attention regularly to understand the difficulties and challenges in order to solve other problems for them in a timely manner.
