Meanwhile, residents of O'Kanthor Tbong village said that this year farmers are happy with the price of rice and reduce the cost of water supply services from $ 130 to $ 105 per hectare per season when there is Change water supply service providers that help reduce production costs and increase profits to another level.
According to the results of the inspection and meeting with the farmers, the rice crop has grown well and the harvest has started gradually. Farmers get 4 to 6 tons of rice per hectare, on average 5 tons per hectare.
The price of rice this year is good, an average of 1,000 riel / kg. The average cost for rice production per hectare is about 3 million riels. Therefore, farmers can get about 5 million riel per hectare and average profit of about 2 million riel / hectare. According to a rough calculation, the income of farmers from the cultivation of all rehabilitated rice crops in Kampong Thom province is about 12 million dollars and can make a profit of about 4.8 million dollars.
