(Kampong Chhnang): In order to avoid the impact on some fish species conservation areas in the Tonle Sap Lake, the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries has sent a working group to inspect and organize fishing areas and set the fishing equipment properly according to the technical specifications to the people. Who is engaged in oyster fishing in Tonle Sap Lake, Kampong Chhnang Province.
He said that the working group of the National Fisheries Administration has also determined the fishing gear and engine power to pull the gear, allowing only 24 horsepower and dividing the oyster fishing area with the standard definition of 8 locations in 3 districts. There are Samboribo, Kampong Leng district and Kampong Chhnang city. These three locations are mapped by the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries.
He added that currently, the Ministry has also allowed the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Department of Agriculture to issue permits (noodles) to people who have applied to the Fisheries Administration for fishing, but must first pass the inspection of fishing equipment and machinery. Recently submitted to the Department of Agriculture to sign a permit (wearing noodles) to find the whole season from now until the closed season, but can only be allowed to fish in areas designated by the Ministry.
