To date, there are more than 100 permits (noodles) that he has applied to the Director of the Department of Agriculture, and only 80 have been accepted. Due to this season, some people who are engaged in oyster fishing business are busy cultivating their fields when they are ready, so they come to get a permit (wearing noodles) to go fishing again.
