(Phnom Penh): As promised by Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh recently, he will respect the request from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Head of the Royal Government, to provide title deeds to the people living on the Borei Keila building. Located in Khan 7 Makara.
In fact, on the morning of February 1, 2023, the team of the Department of Land Management, Urban Planning, Construction and Cadastral Affairs of Phnom Penh, in cooperation with local authorities and other stakeholders, went to collect the names of the people who live on the Borei Keila building. That to collect data for the preparation of title deeds for those citizens in the future.
