(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Commerce has taken another step towards the technology system by officially launching an automated system (digital technology system) to manage the administration to manage civil servants.
The launching ceremony of the Ministry of Commerce's civil servant management automation system was held on the morning of January 31, 2023 under the presidency of Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce.
The Minister added that the general civil servants of the Ministry of Commerce (besides the officers in charge of personnel management of the Personnel Department) can check personal information, check officials in the department or office and update their information. In addition, general civil servants can use the automation services of the Ministry of Commerce and the Trade Statistics System.
Mr. Pan Sosak stated that in the next phase, the technical team of the Ministry of Commerce will add other important functions according to the actual needs to ensure that the general administrative automation management system is more convenient, fast, efficient, increase communication. Employment, promote the growth of labor productivity in line with the current development of technological systems.
