3. Achieving the ASEAN Framework for Sustainable Tourism in the Post-Kovid-19 Crisis.
He said the meeting will also review key points of ASEAN tourism activities and approve some protocol documents of the four ASEAN Commission meetings, including:
1. ASEAN Tourism Market Partnership Working Group Meeting 2. Meeting of the ASEAN Tourism Competitiveness Commission 3. Meeting of the ASEAN Tourism Expert Review Committee 4. Meeting of the Sustainable and Environmental Tourism Development Committee.
