Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng stated, "This new law has already passed the National Road Safety Committee and we are sending it to the literary group to help spell it clearly I hope to help reduce "Traffic accidents, because the old law has some inconsistencies, so I think can help a lot (reduce traffic accidents)."
