Kratie provincial authorities advise Vietnamese to dismantle floating port house in Chit Borei district
(Kratie): The Kratie Provincial Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries has invited 6 Vietnamese fishermen, representing 6 families, to dismantle floating floating houses and fish farms in the Russey Char feudal control and conservation area. Thmor Kre Commune, Chet Borey District, Kratie Province.
