Techo Techo National Hospital announces recruitment of 300 contracted staff
(Phnom Penh): The Techo Santepheap National Hospital has announced the recruitment of 300 contracted officers in 12 majors and majors from the date of this announcement until February 10, 2023.
The announcement of the above contracted officials was made in accordance with the high speech of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia on January 19, 2023 during the inspection ceremony of the progress of the construction project of Techo Santepheap National Hospital.
The selection criteria is that all candidates must be at least 18 years old, Cambodian nationality, healthy and fit, honest, friendly and have high commitment to work, respect and follow the assignment of the hospital.
Please read the details below: Minister of Information: The Club of Journalists is a good partner of the Ministry, which is full of veteran journalists who understand the law and the profession.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Khieu Kanharith, Minister of Information, stated that the Club of Cambodian Journalists (CCJ) is a good partner of the Ministry of Information and a representative of the Ministry of Information when inviting Cambodian journalists to participate. Overseas seminars are especially full of professional veteran journalists.
The ceremony was attended by the leadership of the Ministry of Information, representative of Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh and more than 300 journalists on the afternoon of January 27, 2023 yesterday at Boeung Meas Restaurant in Sangkat Chroy Changva, Khan Chroy Changva, Phnom Penh. .
Minister Khieu Kanharith emphasized: "For almost 30 years, the Club of Journalists has been one of the best partners or organizations with the Ministry of Information. Therefore, the Ministry always chooses the Club of Cambodian Journalists as the representative of the whole Cambodian press.
