Man with mental illness beats his wife to death in Por Sen Chey
(Phnom Penh): An old man had a mental illness and failed to take medicine, suddenly moved and beat his wife to death in a pool of blood. This incident happened on the evening of January 27, 2023 in the village of Chumpouvorn 2, Sangkat Choam Chao III, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
According to local reports, the attacker, 59-year-old Seang Set, was on the run and police were pursuing him. The victim's wife, 54-year-old Ly Sophea.
Prior to the incident, while the children were busy going out, they stayed in the house with only two people, then did not know what happened, so the husband beat his wife to death. The incident happened at 1 pm. No one knew, but at around 4 pm, the neighbors saw the husband walking out of the house with a piece of metal pipe, but did not notice that he beat his wife to death.
Later, when his children entered the house and found his mother dead in a pool of blood in the dwarf room, he shouted in surprise and called the 711 rescue team to take him to the rescue, but when he arrived, he found the victim. He is dead. Minister of Agriculture Leads Experts to Visit Sela Pepper in Memot District, Tbong Khmum Province
