Kandal Provincial Authority Visits and Provides Donations to Flood Victims at Temporary Accommodation in Takhmao City
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hak Sok Makara, Deputy Governor of Kandal Province, on behalf of Mr. Kong Sophoan, Governor of Kandal Province, and the working group of the Provincial Administrative Unit, on January 27, 2023, visited and talked and brought gifts to the people. Affected by the floods, the temporary shelter along Prek Thi is located in Sangkat Roka Khpos, Takhmao City, Kandal Province.
Taking this opportunity, Mr. Hak Sok Makara continued to inspect the construction site for temporary accommodation for the people affected by the flood and brought the donations of the Kandal Provincial Administration to distribute to the people. At present, a total of 22 families live in Prek Samrong village, Roka Khpos commune, Takhmao city.
Kandal Provincial Administration has prepared houses for the people affected by the floods along Prek Thi, now receiving temporary accommodation, including bathrooms, toilets, water supply system for all affected people. .
Europe turns to firewood amid uncertainty over gas, electricity supplies
(LIBINA): Demand for firewood as an alternative source of fuel has risen sharply in Europe in recent months amid uncertainty over gas and electricity supplies as winter approaches. This is according to the release by the AFP news agency on Friday, January 27, 2023.
This phenomenon has prompted some to express concern about the future of Europe's forests, the world's largest forest and home to most of the planet's biodiversity.
The European Union has been stuck in an energy crisis for months with the effects of the Russian war in Ukraine, which has led to drastic changes in energy prices.
Indian police charge 10 with murder after bridge collapse kills 135
NEW DELHI: Indian police on Friday charged 10 people with murder in connection with the collapse of a colonial swing bridge last year that killed at least 135 people. This is according to the release by the AFP news agency on Friday, January 27, 2023.
The 145-year-old swing bridge in Morbi was crowded with hundreds of spectators when it collapsed on October 30. The bridge was reopened just days before the incident. Most of the victims were women and children who drowned.
Minister Thong Khon Leads Discussions on Strengthening Tourist Services at International Border and International Gateways
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism, on January 26, 2023, chaired the first plenary meeting of the Inter-Ministerial Commission to facilitate the travel and transportation of tourists and passengers in the port area. International Border Crossing and International Border Gate (NCCT) to strengthen the service system for tourists at international border gates and international gateways across the country.
After the meeting, Mr. Hor Sarun, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Tourism, told reporters that the strengthening of the service system for tourists at the international border and international gates across the country is necessary to attract international tourists to enter. Come to Cambodia.
Mr. Hor Sarun continued that the ICC Inter-Ministerial Commission has tried to eliminate unnecessary barriers at the international border and international gates because when tourists come to the gate, they have to do something. Easy to complete the entry into Cambodia, providing warmth and hospitality to tourists from the international border and international gates.
Secretary of State for the Ministry of Tourism said that "the authorities at the gates, both immigration, customs, health, must be gentle, friendly, firm in the work, which is attractive for international tourists who come to our country."
He stressed the strengthening of the service system for tourists at international border crossings and international gates, which the relevant authorities must pay attention to strictly implement.
Mr. Hor Sarun emphasized that for the visa fee that tourists have to pay at the international border and international border gates, the price list must be clearly stated and the fee should not be exceeded. Make guests wonder, upset or dissatisfied with anything.
He added that the Inter-Ministerial Commission (ECCC) has made efforts to correct the work and some irregularities at the border, such as eliminating the group of runners to customers who charge more than the principle of the money changer to the guests. Insufficient number of exchange rates or some problems, customers visit the casino before crossing the border.
