Minister Chea Vandeth Meets Citizens and Examines the Progress of Mobile Service Quality in Borey Peng Huoth, Boeung Snor, with 70% Better Results
(Phnom Penh): In the afternoon of January 27, 2023, Mr. Chea Vandeth, Minister of Posts and Telecommunications, inspected the progress of the quality of telephone service and talk with the people to show the progress of work to improve the quality of telecommunication services in Borey Peng Huot. Sangkat Niroth, Khan Chbar Ampov, Phnom Penh.
There was also the participation of the working group to improve the quality of telecommunication services in the eight groups of the Ministry of Borey, the operator of the mobile phone service, the operator of the Internet service, the operator of the tower and the people living in Borey Peng Huot, a total of 294 people. People.
