Vorn Samphas, Country Director of ADA International Cambodia, stated that ADA Action will play a leading role in the Joint Partnership Program to Provide Education Opportunity for Children with Disabilities in Cambodia (CCOSC), which 29 partner organizations will conduct. The work covers 2,694 target schools, with the project targeting 116,396 newly enrolled children across Cambodia.
