Mr. Chhit Sokhon, Minister of Cults and Religions, said that the celebration of the "100th Anniversary of the Gospel" was held to thank Jesus for his Christian faith in the beautiful land of Cambodia and to thank for the peace under his leadership. The wise and skillful of Samdech Techo Prime Minister.
The Minister stated that this event clearly demonstrates the full rights and freedoms of the general population in respecting and practicing religious beliefs in Cambodia, and that all religious activities and practices are guaranteed by the state under the conditions Does not affect other beliefs or religions.
The minister also said that Christianity is highly valued by the government, the general population has full religious rights, and no one is forced to believe in any religion. Except under the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, all religions were destroyed to the root of the clergy, religions were slaughtered or decapitated, pagodas, temples, religious schools, scriptures were almost completely destroyed.
