Through the draft of the National Scout Strategic Plan of Cambodia 2023-2027, which will be discussed and provided now will be an effective road map to develop the Cambodian National Scout Movement in response to the vision of increasing the membership of 250,000 in 2027 and become a leading youth organization in educating children and youth in the Kingdom of Cambodia.
