Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen Presiding Over the Graduation Ceremony for More Than 3,000 Western University Winners
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of January 26, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the graduation ceremony for graduates of Associate Degree, Master's Degree, Master's and Doctoral Degree of Western University. 3,000 of them graduated in the 2019-2020 academic year, 2020-2021 academic year and 2021-2022 academic year.
The graduation ceremony was held at the Chroy Changvar International Convention and Exhibition Center in Phnom Penh, with a total of 3,232 graduates of Western University, including 1,897 female students.
