* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his pleasure to preside over the graduation ceremony for Western University students.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that human resources are essential for the society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very happy to see the progress on human resource training.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that political mistakes and war were the reasons for Cambodia's poverty.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the coup d'etat of March 18, 1970 destroyed Cambodia to its roots.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has a large labor force, but the knowledge and skills to meet the needs of the company is still limited.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Singapore grows because of its excellent human resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Singapore adheres to the main principles of peace, political stability and order.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges educational institutions to pay attention to strengthening the quality of training.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the training is not to get a degree, but to have real knowledge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is considering arranging student accommodation for female students, poor students and foreign students.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the accommodation for students is not only in Phnom Penh, but also in the provinces.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he did not understand the policy of some political parties, and all of them seemed to want to overhaul the country's leadership when they won the election.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this weekend the CPP will hold a two-day party congress.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on students to continue their studies or conduct additional research to strengthen their capacity.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the people to unite to make the SEA Games a national movement.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that assisting in demining training is a purely humanitarian work.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the sweeping of Amin is a task that all countries in the world must participate in.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the reaction of the dispute between journalists and those who helped lift motorcycles at the Chroy Changvar Bridge. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that what right do journalists have to apologize?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requests to end the correspondence on the dispute between journalists and motorcycle lifters at the Chroy Changva bridge and the case of a teacher cutting his daughter's hair in Sampov Loun district, Battambang province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advises to call online journalists to educate and guide professional ethics.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on journalists not to act as judicial police officers on behalf of doctors.
