(Preah Sihanouk): The Land Traffic Police Office, in cooperation with the Anti-Drug Bureau of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police, on January 25, 2023, enforced the law on road traffic by controlling alcohol. , Check the technical characteristics of the vehicle, speed and check for drugs on the driver.
