In both of Mr. Chea Pisey's notices, he emphasized that if all business owners do not comply with the contents of this notice, the Tuol Kork district administration will take measures to dismantle and confiscate irresponsibly. All loss of property and materials at the site, and in case of stubborn obstruction of the instructions, the Tuol Kork district administration will implement legal administrative measures.
Mr. Chea Pisey, on behalf of the Tuol Kork District Administration, strongly hopes and strongly believes that all business owners cooperate and implement the contents of the above announcement with a high sense of responsibility. Construction site from Chamkar Leu district to Stung Trang district, Kampong Cham province has been opened
