Mr. An Khun said that the Siem Reap Provincial Council Council has been working hard to continue and participate in the implementation of the project to enhance the institutional capacity and implementation to ensure the satisfaction of local councilors, both management and leadership functions and responsibilities. .
Mr. An Khun continued that in the third mandate, the Council Association must focus on providing public services faster and more reliable to meet the needs of the people. In that, there must be cooperation with development partners and the private sector to help as well as help solve the concerns of the people, especially poor women, orphans and vulnerable groups, such as strong foundations due to good leadership. .
The Deputy Governor of Siem Reap said that on behalf of the provincial administration, all members are kindly requested to listen, discuss and approve the statute, as the Local Council Association is a partner of the Royal Government in the process of decentralization and reform. Centralized in Cambodia.
Ms. You Sophea also expressed her deep gratitude to the Siem Reap Local Council Association, which in the past has worked hard to fulfill its role and responsibilities to create many great achievements and actively contribute to various reform programs. Of the Royal Government, especially the reform of decentralization and deconcentration in accordance with its statute, which is also kept at the Ministry of Interior.
At the same time, she also requested the relevant departments and units as well as municipalities, districts, communes, sangkats in Siem Reap to continue to support the implementation of the association's activities to help solve the challenges that members are facing in providing services to the people. .
