Phnom Penh Capital Administration Announces Temporary Avoidance of All Types of Vehicles During the Extraordinary General Assembly of the Cambodian People's Party
(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Capital Administration informs all the people in Phnom Penh that on January 28 and 29, 2023 at 07:00 AM, the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party will hold Extraordinary General Assembly of the National Representative of the Cambodian People's Party at the 7 Makara Palace in Tonle Bassac Sangkat, Khan Chamkar Mon, Phnom Penh.
In order for the above program to run smoothly, maintain security, safety, order and public order, as well as avoid traffic jams, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration will avoid traffic on all types of vehicles on Norodom Boulevard (from the traffic light to Kbal Thnal flyover and the area around the venue) on January 28 and 29, 2023 from 05:00 until the end of the program.
