The meeting mentioned include:
First, the settlement of border issues has improved. Second, continue to implement the mechanism of the dialogue between the commanders of the two countries' armies. The two countries continue to cooperate in preventing drugs, cross-border theft, deforestation and other crimes, and preventing terrorism and crime along the border.
