At the same time, Dr. Ouk Rabun said that this has been making progress in all areas, especially the rural situation in Cambodia has improved significantly by contributing to improving living standards. Of rural people has added another level.
"However, with the huge demand and limited resources, we recognize that rural development has not yet been adequately met in terms of both quantity and quality, despite development partners and civil society organizations." Many have been actively contributing to the Royal Government.
