(Phnom Penh): In the traditional Chinese New Year 2023, we see Chinese people living around the world, as well as Cambodians of Chinese descent, celebrated the New Year with great joy. .
How is the Chinese New Year of the Rabbit in the belief system?
Khmer civilization expert Rath Sandab said that for the traditional Chinese New Year 2023, the rabbit, which is one of the 12 animal symbols in each year, according to the Chinese astrological cycle, according to the Chinese belief system, the rabbit is A symbol of good luck, energetic, positive intuition, gentle patience in a peaceful way.
Therefore, in the Chinese belief system, rabbits are considered to be gentle, intelligent creatures, waiting for opportunities with patience and attention to detail, because rabbits can move by. Fast and agile.
In this sense, the rabbit in social reality, the rabbit is an attractive animal for people around the world, with its warm warmth and good manners make it attractive. At the same time, it is also reluctant to be open-minded with its true feelings, because rabbits like to escape from problems to maintain peace and tranquility.
Finally, Mr. Rath Sandab stated that in terms of the Chinese belief system in the tradition of decorating the house and other make-up, etc., decorating and wearing red or diamond jewelry can help prevent bad luck because To have a good hong shui in the house that can help maintain a peaceful atmosphere, especially for the year of the rabbit, which tends to like red, pink and emerald.
