Commentary: The recovery of tourism and consumption on Chinese New Year is a sign of Chinese economic growth in the new year
It is observed that at all departure stations across the country, all passengers have smiling faces as they return to reunite with their families on New Year's Day. Everywhere there is a happy holiday atmosphere as life returns to pre-Kovid crisis.
Of course, the fact that people can travel back and forth without worrying about infectious diseases, can happily reunite families, can travel anywhere, whether inside or outside the country during the New Year, it proves that tourism And the holiday market has revived. Both sectors are important factors contributing to China's economic growth.
Compared to before the Kovid crisis three years ago, although the Chinese economy has maintained positive growth, the impact of infectious diseases is not small. Therefore, the government needs to study scientifically about its national situation, that is, in addition to adhering to the principle of keeping the population as the core, saving lives primarily in the context of epidemics, also need to adjust the measures to be consistent. The actual evolution of the infectious disease situation.
China's decision to reopen the country has not only rejuvenated the bustling atmosphere of the Chinese New Year, but has also become a positive sign for national economic recovery and foreign trade. . The Chinese Ministry of Foreign Affairs has repeatedly stated that the Chinese economy will grow significantly this year, which will bring new opportunities to achieve global economic recovery.
On January 18, during a video conference with cadres and local people, Chinese President Xi Jinping said: "My biggest wish is to hope that all our compatriots "Happy New Year!"
Of course, as life has returned to normal, on the occasion of the Chinese New Year this year, a happy atmosphere has spread throughout China, and it is believed that in the new year, China will make a new contribution to Restore the global economy, especially peace, security, prosperity and progress of the world.
Duke Kouch Mengly stated that Cambodia has not been as warm, cool and stable as it is now for almost 500 years due to the civil war and the war of neighboring countries. But now Cambodia can keep the territory and keep the peace between the people.
