(Siem Reap): On the morning of January 20, 2023, Ukrainian demining officers continued to visit the Peace Mine Action Museum, located in Anlong 2 Village, Trapeang Thom Commune, Basat Bakong District, Siem Reap Province, on an area of approximately 12 hectares.
The museum also houses a collection of all kinds of small and large weapons, remnants of the war, demining, tanks, ammunition and artillery, all kinds of demining vehicles, demining machinery and art. Remnants of war. The Museum of Peace Mine Action also features exhibits on war history, war activities, post-war UXO issues, and post-clearance development.
In addition, the museum is also very useful for young people born before the war to learn about the war and the effects that have occurred in war countries.
