At the same time, Minister Pan Sosak also highlighted Cambodia's high commitment in Timor-Leste's accession to the World Trade Organization. In particular, Cambodia supports the negotiation process so that Timor-Leste can become a member of the World Trade Organization in 2023, in accordance with the wishes of the Government of Timor-Leste.
