(Siem Reap): Siem Reap Provincial Authority and Oddar Meanchey Provincial Authority on January 19, 2023 jointly held a meeting to discuss the implementation of the project to improve the 68 km road from Svay Leu district, Siem Reap province to Trapeang Prasat district, Oddar Meanchey province. Siem Reap Province.
