The Senior Minister considered the assistance of the Chinese friends as an important part in the process towards mine-free Cambodia in 2025, in line with the vision of the Prime Minister.
Wang Wentian thanked the Senior Minister and the mine authority delegation for coming to the Chinese Embassy to celebrate the Chinese New Year in strengthening cooperation between our two countries and peoples.
