Mr. Bun Hon chaired an inter-ministerial meeting to continue reviewing and discussing the draft Royal Decree on respecting the title of tycoon
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Bun Hon, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Interior and Chairman of the Inter-Ministerial Working Group to Study the Preparation of Legal Documents for the Management of the Duke, the Order of the Duke and the Removal of the Duke on the morning of January 19, 2023. Meeting to continue reviewing and discussing the draft Royal Decree on respecting the title of tycoon.
The meeting was attended by the Secretary of State and Undersecretary of State, representatives of relevant ministries, institutions, vice chairmen and members of the inter-ministerial working group to study the preparation of legal documents for the management of the duke, the conferment of the duke and the removal of the duke.
