Mr. Bun Hon said, "This Royal Decree is necessary for the nation: firstly, to ensure the preservation of the reputation of individuals who help the nation, and secondly, to ensure the value of the use of special functions. There is order and order for consumers, which is why the Royal Government recommended the preparation of a draft Royal Decree on the title of this tycoon.
In addition, Mr. Bun Hon stated that the meeting to review and discuss the draft Royal Decree on the honor of the tycoon has held several meetings to review and discuss, and this meeting continued to discuss and discuss. Uniforms, medals, necklaces and belts for the official title of the Duke of Cambodia.
At the same time, the Chairman of the Inter-Ministerial Working Group of the Ministry of Interior also thanked all the working groups who helped to prepare the official uniform of the Duke.
