BEIJING, Jan. 19 (Xinhua) - The Press Office of the State Council of the People's Republic of China (PRC) released a white paper on China's green development in the new era, highlighting China's ideas, practices and achievements of green development. In the new era and share the development experience of China's green as well.
The White Paper shows that since the 18th CPC National Congress, China has been pushing for a green revolution for economic and social development in all aspects, building modernization where people and nature harmonize, creating ecological miracles and green development miracles. Be interested in the world.
Green development has become a prominent feature of modern Chinese-style modernization. China's green development extends to the global green development framework and has global potential.
The White Paper emphasizes that China will continue to walk the path of green development unwaveringly, promote the development of higher quality, more efficient, more equitable, more sustainable and safer. Promoting sustainable development is the common task of all countries. China is willing to work with the international community to build a more beautiful world.
