At the same time, Ms. O Vandin also said that in general, when it comes to private hospitals, it is not free, it is necessary for users to pay a fee according to the regulations of that hospital or that service. In particular, public hospitals may be exempted from the use of the Royal Government's Equity Fund for the Poor.
