At the same time, Ms. O Vandin said that what is the consideration of the Ministry of Health is to ask the hospitals - clinics to have a price list to avoid any problems when patients use the services of the hospital - That clinic already.
Ms. O Vandin said that when a patient comes to use the service, it is necessary for the hospital-clinic to provide the service to the patient in advance or have a price list so that the user has the right to decide. Use any service without coercion.
Ms. O Vandin also said that the Ministry of Health is currently working to make more choices related to the health sector to make it easier for people to decide to use the service. Technical bases, satellite systems, meteorology and hydrology and human resource training
The Minister briefed the delegation on the achievements and work that the Ministry has achieved and is implementing, as well as the work ahead in the framework of water resources and meteorology to contribute to addressing the challenges of climate change to ensure water security to meet the needs of use. And sustainable development.
Mr. Jong-seong Lim expressed his pleasure to meet and discuss with the current Minister and praised the achievements of the Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology as well as the work to be carried out in the contribution mission. To the development and economic growth of Cambodia even better.
For the cooperation between the two countries in the past, Korea has contributed significantly to the development of water resources and has provided many positives to the development of Cambodia. Mr. Jong-seong Lim will bring the above request to the Royal Government of Korea and stated that in the future, Korea will work together in the field of water resources, not only for Cambodia, but in the whole of Asia. .
