(Phnom Penh): Speaking to members of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia at the University of Health Sciences this morning, January 18, 2023, Mr. Hun Many, President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, said that "the benefits of volunteering is. "It's an opportunity to test yourself, develop leadership and set an example."
