Ratanakkiri: Mr. Nhem Sam Oeun, Governor of Ratanakkiri Province, and government officials around the province on the morning of January 18, 2023, presided over the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of a throne for the Buddha at Wat Seila Kiri Rukkaram (Wat Phnom). Beng) is located in Village 2, Sangkat Kachanh, Banlung City.
