(Phnom Penh): Lt. Gen. Lim Sokharasmey, Director of the Private Security Management Department of the National Police General Commission, on January 18, 2023, called on the private security service providers to continue to deploy their private security forces to join the forces. Competent to defend the 2023 SEA Games, which Cambodia is hosting.
