(Siem Reap): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, has issued a recommendation to the authorities and the competent forces to increase the prevention of criminals who destroy, cut down and trade in heritage and encourage those who volunteer to participate in prevention. Protect as well as voluntarily hand over the artifacts to the competent authorities for restoration.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng said this at the inauguration ceremony of the Angkor Heritage Protection Police Building in Kork Ta Chan Village, Kork Chak Sangkat, Siem Reap City on January 17, 2023.
Samdech Krala Hom further advised that the Heritage Protection Police Unit must review and determine the position of the priority protection base and the permanent patrol movement, especially at night at key points of the Angkor area and other related areas.
The Heritage Protection Police Unit is to increase education, strengthen morale, discipline, force and professional consciousness, love the national cultural heritage in order to prevent and absolutely reduce anarchy in the Angkor area and other areas through the implementation of discipline. Clear as well as legal measures that are transparent and absolutely fair. This is according to the addition of Prince Krala Hom Sar Kheng.
In addition, the Heritage Protection Police Unit must continue to strengthen cooperation with the competent forces and local authorities at all levels in the protection of safety, security and maintain public order, especially the protection of safety and security of national and international guests who come to visit or Travel in Angkor, Siem Reap and other areas.
Samdech Krala Hom added that the Siem Reap Provincial Authority, APSARA Authority, the Heritage Protection Police Unit and relevant institutions must continue to work to preserve the natural environment that is part of the cultural landscape of Angkor by replanting trees, increasing greenery and continuing to restore the system. Ancient irrigation to strengthen conservation work, as well as create comfort for citizens, national and international tourists, leisure and entertainment.
