In the morning of January 17, 2023, the General said that, having received an order from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, he led the army to provide emergency assistance to the people.
The general immediately mobilized all 600 troops to help the people, including dismantling the houses of the victims, and distributed gifts and funds to the affected people.
At the same time, the General also instructed the people living along this canal to be careful and be very careful about the risk of floods, lest any accident happen, especially to pay attention. For eating clean, drinking clean, living clean with eating clean food and so on.
