This weekend's classroom forum includes extracurricular activities including: presentations on Khmer Rouge history, exhibitions, face-to-face meetings with survivors of the Khmer Rouge regime, visits to community memorials, and visits. Go to the location of the former battlefield between Lon Nol soldiers and the Khmer Rouge army.
