By: Owners commented: International community "vote of confidence" on Chinese vaccine
China's policy on preventing and controlling Kovid 19 is changing the world, all of which welcome this. But some US politicians and the media have taken the opportunity to once again attack and slander the Chinese vaccine, attempting to undermine China's efforts to fight the epidemic.
Good or bad Chinese vaccines need to be scientifically evaluated. Scientific and factual studies confirm that the Chinese vaccine conforms to the World Health Organization (WHO) standard for 19 vaccines against measles, mumps and rubella.
The study also found that the elderly over the age of 60 after two doses of Chinese vaccination, the rate of prevention and morbidity and mortality were 69.9 percent after the three doses of the vaccine. Severe cases of illness and death could rise to 97.9 percent.
Vaccines as a weapon against the virus are not a political tool for some Americans. Some Americans spread rumors that are unconstitutional and contradictory over and over again. If you take the time to think about your problems in preventing and managing infectious diseases, it is better to do the real work in the fight against them. Infectious diseases for the local people and the whole world.
