If nothing changes, Duke Kouch Mengly, Founder, Chairman and CEO of Mengly JSC. Kouch Education will list its company on the Cambodia Securities Exchange at the end of March 2023. Meng Ly J. Kouch Education will be the first private educational institution to enter the stock market with the goal of raising funds to expand the American Intercontinental School (AIS) across 160 branches nationwide.
