Six agreements and memoranda of understanding between Cambodia and the Maldives were signed during Samdech Techo Hun Sen's visit
(Maldives): Six agreements and memoranda of understanding between the Royal Government of Cambodia and the Maldives were signed this morning, January 16, 2023, during the visit of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia to the Maldives.
1: Agreement between the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Government of the Republic of Maldives on visa waiver for holders of official and ordinary diplomatic passports. (Signed by Mr. Prak Sokhon, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation).
