On January 13, 2023, the company of Duke Try Pheap held a meeting to review the results of 2022 and set the direction for 2023. The meeting was attended by the management of Try Pheap Group and executives from 10 other subsidiaries.
The full-day meeting featured presentations of the past year and proposals for the new year from executives from the 10 subsidiaries. According to reports from each company, the results are good, but there are also some challenges that need to be improved for the new year.
After a full day of meetings, Duke Try Pheap closed the meeting in the afternoon. Addressing the leadership of all departments, Duke Try Pheap highly appreciated and appreciated the leaders and staff of all departments who worked hard and mentally to contribute to make the company run better.
Duke Try Pheap also said that Samdech Techo's effective and swift intervention in the 19 epidemic of Kovid, as well as the effects of the war in Ukraine, was an important part of running his company's business. Overcome any difficulties and get better results.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers the private sector an important development partner. Through investment and business operations, the private sector provides income to the nation through the payment of taxes. Not only that, through those businesses also contribute to providing jobs to the people.
Duke Try Pheap's company now employs more than 2,000 people with a decent wage. The staff of Duke Try Pheap's company are mostly rural people, which is a big contribution to the Royal Government in contributing to the reduction of poverty in rural areas.
In addition to contributing to the employment of the people, Duke Try Pheap's company also contributes to humanitarian activities with the Royal Government by providing a series of other assistance to solve difficulties in the event of disasters. In 2022, Duke Try Pheap donated hundreds of tons of rice to the Royal Government for distribution to flood victims.
For 2023, Duke Try Pheap has announced that he will continue to contribute to humanitarian activities with the Royal Government. Neak Oknha said that the result of his company was born from the social process, so he was happy to contribute to the protection and resolution of social problems with the Royal Government.
Before concluding the meeting, Duke Try Pheap encouraged the management and staff of all departments of the company to continue to work hard to achieve better results and develop their capabilities even better. Duke Try Pheap has announced that he is not afraid to raise the salaries of loyal and talented employees.
After the meeting, Duke Try Pheap also prepared a solidarity meal for all staff with a happy and friendly atmosphere. Brazil arrests former security official in Brasilia over last week's riots (Video inside)
