He added that the Royal Government of Cambodia has always considered maintaining peace, which we have been struggling to achieve, as the most indispensable priority for the development of the country. Through favorable conditions of peace, people who are investors, businessmen, traders and merchants, both domestic and foreign, with confidence and mental well-being will be stable without worries.
The Honorary General expressed his appreciation and appreciation to the monks, teachers and grandparents of the people of Kandal Steung District, Kandal Province who have contributed to the Royal Government in maintaining peace, security, public order and construction. Develop the nation.
The General said that building and developing a nation is not a simple and easy task, building a nation from scratch is really difficult and faces many challenges, complexities and inconveniences. Do not miss. However, under the leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister, Cambodia has been on the right and clear path of development.
On that occasion, the Honorary General handed over the suffix to Preah Vihear Pit Meas pagoda to continue to build new achievements with an additional amount of more than 386 million Riels and also brought the precious gift from Samdech Techo Prime Minister and Samdech Kittipritthbandit To grandparents, district councils, communes, teachers, youth, workers and many other competent forces.
