(Phnom Penh): In the morning of Sunday, January 15, 2023, with the permission of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Duke Kith Meng, President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, led a delegation of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce to accompany Samdech Techo Director The Minister pays an official visit to the Republic of Maldives from 15 to 17 January 2023.
The Cambodian Chamber of Commerce in collaboration with the Ministry of Economic Development of the Republic of Maldives will organize the Cambodia-Maldives Business Forum, which will be held on the morning of 16 January 2023 under the chairmanship of Mr. Fayyaz Ismail, Minister of Economic Development of the Maldives.
The business forum focuses on promoting business relations between the two countries and also discusses the exchange of opportunities, investment climate and potential sectors, with the participation of senior officials of the Ministry of Economic Development, the Maldives, Maldives and Cambodian businessmen.
The Cambodian Chamber of Commerce will sign a Memorandum of Understanding with the Maldives Chamber of Commerce and Industry on the morning of January 16, 2023 under the chairmanship of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
The MoU is aimed at promoting and enhancing industrial, business and economic cooperation between the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Republic of Maldives. In addition, a delegation from the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce will visit industrial, tourism and major development projects in the Republic of Maldives.
