* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that journalists and media providers are better.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that those who like to spread false information are easy to sow without supporters.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advises national and sub-national institutions not to take journalists as enemies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is necessary to communicate and connect well with the media, which is beneficial for society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the Ministry of Information to issue a law on the press in the seventh mandate.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recommends the establishment of a digital TV nursery and complete the launch of AnneLook by 2025.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that some NGOs have made excessive demands regarding the law on the press.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the media to participate in maintaining peace, stability, security and social order by disseminating all inactive issues at the local level related to the policy of safe villages and communes.
