Pursuant to the rules and procedures for the annual review of the voter list and voter registration, any person has the right to file a complaint and / or objection in writing on a complaint (Form 1202) related to the initial voter list and The list of voters who will be removed from the voter list to the Commune / Sangkat Council within 10 days after the posting date (January 23, 2023 is the last day).
* Complaints may be made about the loss of a voter's name or name on the voter list, but inaccurate records of relevant data or information he or she provided, or names on the voter list that will be removed from the voter list. In the commune.
Complaints may be made against any person who is on the initial voter list, but he or she does not qualify to be on the voter list or to any person who is on the voter list in more than one place.
Please be informed that the initial voter list and the list of voters to be removed from the NEC voter list have been posted at Commune / Sangkat Halls and at some locations in communes / sangkats throughout the country.
