The Prime Minister of Japan sends a message to Samdech Techo Hun Sen congratulating the 70th anniversary of the establishment of relations between the two countries in 2023
In a message received by Fresh News on January 12, 2023, Mr. Fumio Kishida stated: On behalf of the Government of Japan and the people of Japan, I would like to sincerely congratulate you on this special occasion. On the occasion of the 70th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between Japan and the Kingdom of Cambodia.
"I am also pleased to promote the bilateral relationship to the level of" comprehensive strategic partnership "that I announced with Samdech Techo last November," he added.
He added that he looks forward to the people of both countries attending the 70th anniversary of Japan-Cambodia friendship, which will be held throughout the year, and see profound changes.
The Prime Minister of Japan wishes the Royal Family of Cambodia prosperity and wishes Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo good health and continued success in all tasks and wishes all Cambodians happiness. Samdech Techo Hun Sen Sends Message to Japanese Prime Minister Congratulating on the 70th Anniversary of the Establishment of Bilateral Relations
