"I am very pleased that the Cambodia-Japan bilateral relationship has reached a new milestone as we upgrade our relationship from a family partnership to a comprehensive strategic partnership," he added. .
Samdech Techo strongly hopes that the promotion of a comprehensive strategic partnership between the two countries will bring even greater benefits to our two peoples and nations.
"At the same time, as this year is also the 50th anniversary of the ASEAN-Japan Friendship and Cooperation, I look forward to working closely with you to make this memorial meeting a success and a success," he said. Further promote ASEAN-Japan relations. I also look forward to meeting with you again this year. ”
