Mr. Hing Thirith said that the date of posting the first voter list and the list of voters to be removed from the 2022 voter list will be on January 13, 2023, which must be approved. In both communes across the country, the two lists are posted side by side at the same location to make it easier for voters to verify their names and data.
Regarding the initial voter list and the list of voters to be removed from the voter list, Mr. Hing Thirith continued that any person has the right to file a complaint and / or object in writing on Form 1202 to the Commune Council. Neighborhood after posting day.
There are three levels of mechanisms and powers for receiving and resolving complaints related to these two lists:
* Commune / Sangkat Council level is the first level where all citizens and stakeholders can file a complaint and / or objection within 10 days after the posting date and the Commune / Sangkat Council must resolve within 3 days. Long after the day received the complaint.
* At the NEC level, in case the complainant, the complainant or the accused or the representative who does not agree with the decision of the Commune / Sangkat Council has the right to complain to the NEC within 5 days Long after the day received Form 1203 from the Commune / Sangkat Council. The NEC must decide on the complaint within 5 days after the date of receipt of the complaint.
* The Constitutional Council is in the event that the complainant or representative who disagrees with the decision of the NEC has the right to appeal and / or appeal to the Constitutional Council within 5 days after the date of receipt of the form. 1203 of the NEC.
