Mr. Park Byung-suk praised the National Assembly President for playing an important role in saving the lives of the people as well as the nation and contributing to the development of Cambodia so far and congratulated the organization of the ASEAN Summit and Relevant summits and the ASEAN Inter-Parliamentary Assembly (AIPA), which Cambodia has hosted in the past, have been a resounding success.
