(Phnom Penh): After being re-elected President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce and Phnom Penh for a new term, Duke Kith Meng, a well-known Cambodian billionaire with many businesses in hand, is determined to lead the way. Chamber of Commerce for the better.
Such a commitment by Duke Kith Meng was made during the closing ceremony of the 4th Mandate Election of the Phnom Penh Chamber of Commerce and the 5th Mandate of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce. The ceremony was held at the General Department of the Phnom Penh-Cambodia Chamber of Commerce on the evening of January 11, 2023.
