At the same time, Duke Kith Meng said that the participation of all traders shows the trust of the Chamber of Commerce to work hard to benefit traders throughout Phnom Penh and throughout Cambodia.
Please be informed that for the election of the President of the Phnom Penh Chamber of Commerce, Duke Kith Meng received a majority of 39 out of 40 votes. Separately, for the election of the President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, Duke Kith Meng received 15 out of 18 votes.
Neak Oknha Kith Meng has been the President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce and Phnom Penh for 18 years and is now elected by the members to lead the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce and Phnom Penh for a new term of 3 years. More.
World Bank cuts global economic forecast for 2023 and warns of global economic downturn
The Washington-based bank said Tuesday that global GDP will grow 1.7 percent this year, less than half of the June forecast. Only. This growth rate will be the third worst in the last three decades after declining in 2009 and 2020.
The World Bank has also cut its growth forecast for 2024, citing chronic high inflation and high interest rates as the main reasons for lowering the forecast. The bank also cited the impact of Russia's invasion of Ukraine and the slowdown in investment.
"The combination of slowing growth, tightening of financial conditions and heavy debt is likely to weaken investment and cause corporations to go bankrupt," the World Bank said. "Urgent global action is needed to mitigate the risk of global economic downturn and the debt crisis."
