The owner of a truck steals a bar across the road against a letter from the Svay Rieng provincial governor to stop overweight trucks in Kampong Ror district
(Svay Rieng): A 30- to 45-tonne truck full of vans broke open barricades to protect overweight trucks, traveling on a newly paved rural road. The inauguration also caused the public to worry about the collapse of the road that the Royal Government built for the rural people to use for easy travel.
Residents have asked the authorities to take action to stop the traders who drive this giant truck, otherwise the road will be damaged. This call was made on January 11, 2023 in O Don Am village, Preah Ponlea commune, Kampong Ror district.
According to the residents, the car was traveling at 8:10 pm on January 9, 2023 on a paved road connecting National Road No. 314 at the border of Trabek village. Prasot commune, Svay Teap district, towards O Don Am village, Preah Ponlea commune, Kampong Rou district, Svay Rieng province.
Mr. Soch Pisey, the governor of Kampong Ror district, would like to thank you for providing this information and he will tell the road builders to prevent it. Regarding this case, Mr. Nuon Ly Hourn, Director of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Svay Rieng Province, said that for a paved road that has not been paved yet, this is the responsibility of the Provincial Department of Rural Development, which is not related to the Department of Public Works. No.
Every night, there are giant trucks carrying high trucks heading to the corridors of the border guards crossing this paved road, and there are always overweight bar guards. This allows the cars to go smoothly, regardless of the impact on the road damage that has just been done. According to the people.
According to the Director of the Department of Rural Development of Svay Rieng Province, he said on January 11, 2023 that he had received this information and that there was a picture of a truck opening a bar, and the Governor of Kampong Ror District would inform the provincial level to have What kind of measures for all these cars as well.
It should be noted that according to the letter of Svay Rieng Provincial Administration on December 8, 2022, informed the Governor of Svay Chrum District, the Governor of Romduol District and the Governor of Kampong Ror District on the coordination of managing the bar at the height of the road to prevent overweight trucks and Wrong-sized recycling vehicles, driving on rural roads.
