(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on January 10, 2023, sent a message of condolences to Lok Chumteav Keo Sham Mo, mourning the death of His Excellency Hong Sun Huot, former Minister of Rural Development, Secretary General of the Red Cross. Cambodia Minister of Health, President of the National AIDS Authority, Second Vice President of the National Assembly, who is her husband.
