Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, please dedicate your prayers to the soul of His Excellency Hong Sun Huot, may he be born soon in the death of all nations, do not be sad. China reaffirms 2023 commitment to deter outside enemies from attempting to break up Taiwan
China has said it is conducting military exercises around Taiwan, focusing on naval and land attacks. The exercise in early January 2023 is the second exercise in less than a month.
The Eastern Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army (PLA) said in a statement on Sunday night that the Eastern Command had organized a joint combat patrol and live combat training at Overseas and airspace around Taiwan.
It should be noted that Taiwan, which has an area of 36,197 square kilometers and is five times smaller than Cambodian territory, is considered by China as part of its territory. The image of Taiwan's secession from the rule of the People's Republic of China became clearer through the 18-hour visit of former US Congresswoman Nancy Pelosi to Taiwan during August 2022.
US President Joe Biden has said he supports the one-China policy, but has hinted that the United States will intervene militarily if the People's Republic of China dares to use force to unite Taiwan.
A Chinese military spokesman for the Eastern Command, Lt. Col. Shi Yi, said the purpose of the exercise was to test joint combat capability and resolutely oppose provocative actions by outside forces. Independent Taiwanese separatist group.
Taiwan's Defense Ministry confirmed on Monday that it had seen 57 Chinese warplanes and four ships operating around the island within 24 hours. The Taiwanese presidential office has condemned China's military exercises.
The January 8, 2023 military exercise coincides with a group of German lawmakers visiting Taiwan, a visit ahead of a 2023 German ministerial visit. The visit of German officials was considered by Beijing to be a violation of the one-China policy.
The Chinese Foreign Ministry spokesman added that the cause of Taiwan's problems was due to the forest law case, colonial hegemony and materialism that had caused global devastation in the past. Deep.
