Cambodian diplomat reiterates Cambodia's full support and cooperation for Indonesia's role as ASEAN chair this year (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Cambodian Deputy Foreign Minister Prak Sokhon reiterated Cambodia's support and cooperation. Cambodia's full cooperation with Indonesia in its role as chair of ASEAN in 2023.
