El Rafeth, former chairman of the Candlelight Khmer Islam Movement, meets with his former activists and promotes the CPP's secession from the Candlelight Party
(Battambang): Mr. El Rafeth, former President of the Khmer Islam Movement of the Candlelight Party, together with Mr. You Serey Vuth, Special Task Force of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and Mr. Phen Phalla, Personal Assistant to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party On January 10, 2023, he met with people and activists from the Candlelight Party in Sophy 1 Village, Sangkat Rattanak, Battambang City, Battambang Province.
The meeting with the people and their activists from the Candlelight Party above is to publicize his departure from the Candlelight Party after losing faith in the leadership of Sam Rainsy and to inform those activists about Political tricks of opposition leaders who want to destroy peace both before and after the election in Cambodia.
In fact, today, Mr. El Rafeth, together with Mr. You Sereyvuth and Mr. Phen Phalla, met with about 300 Cambodian Muslims in Sophy 1 Village, Rattanak Sangkat, Battambang City to inform the activists and Cambodian Muslims about their political participation. With the Cambodian People's Party under the leadership of Samdech Chat Cho Hun Sen and no longer a member of the Fire Party.
On that occasion, according to Mr. Yusiri Vuth, Mr. Ek Rafeth announced that he could not live with the Candlelight Party, which has a policy to destroy the peace of the society by bringing people to protest and he is here. Proclamation reveals all the tricks that the opposition group has wrong plan for invading the society.
He said that for this work, the former president of the Khmer Islam Movement of the Candlelight Party will travel to other provinces to publicize his departure from the opposition and join the CPP, and especially call for Let the activists who used to support him leave the Candlelight Party and join the CPP.
He also apologized to the leaders of the Candlelight Party, stating that he was not upset because his mother, before leaving, also said that only the CPP, when his mother was sick, no one. Except for the CPP, which helped his mother.
He thanked Samdech Techo for taking care of his mother in the past and he will follow his mother's words, as he does not want to live with the opposition, thinking only of opposition, not helping the country.
Mr. El Rafert asked to seek refuge under the shadow of peace of Samdech and serve the Cambodian People's Party from today onwards, he called on the team and leaders with him, the same Khmer Muslims in and outside to join With the Cambodian People's Party. He wished them to wake up and leave the opposition, which thinks only of opposition, without progress.
He claims that he wants to help Dr. Hun Manet, the next generation leader, because only Dr. is the true successor of bamboo. He announced his support for Dr. Hun Manet as Prime Minister from now on. Once again, he deeply thanked Samdech Techo for allowing him to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party for the opportunity to participate in the development of the country.
On the occasion of meeting with provincial activists, Mr. You Serey Vuth, Special Task Force of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, and Mr. Phen Phalla, Personal Assistant to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, will join Mr. Rafert to encourage and ask Welcoming the people who support Mr. Rafat and help explain more about the policy of the Cambodian People's Party under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
On that occasion, Mr. You Serey Vuth also mentioned the peace factor. It is this peace that leads to investment and guarantees jobs for the people. In this regard, both Mr. You Sereyvuth and Mr. Phen Phalla advised all people to work together to protect the current peace in order to have jobs and improve their lives. In particular, maintain peace.
On that occasion, Mr. You Serey Vuth and Mr. Phen Phalla also called on all of you to vote for the Cambodian People's Party so that Samdech Techo can continue to lead the country as a position to maintain peace and keep jobs for the people throughout the country.
