(Phnom Penh): Local investors in the last three years have continued to be the number one investor, which posted the important role of local investors.
The report states that for the whole of 2022, the Royal Government of Cambodia has approved a total of 186 investment projects under a total investment capital of 4,033 million US dollars and can create about 144 thousand jobs.
