(Phnom Penh): His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia, has issued a Royal Decree appointing His Excellency Keo Phong and His Excellency Kong Liva as Assistant to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, with the rank of Deputy Secretary General.
On this special occasion, Lt. Gen. You Serey Vuth, Deputy Chief of Joint Staff of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, and Lt. Gen. Phorn Phalla, Deputy Commander of the 70th Brigade, would like to send a message of congratulations and congratulations to both Excellencies.
